---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';
import esyaFilm from '../../assets/AfterEffects/ESYA Horizon.mp4?url';
import esyaFirst from '../../assets/AfterEffects/esya-first.mp4?url';
---
<SiteLayout title="Previous work | BoreBit Labs" description="Promoting ESYA, IIIT Delhi's premier tech fest, and teaching university and self-growth courses in Unreal Engine.">
  <section class="container page-heading"><span class="eyebrow">Previous work / BoreBit Labs</span><h1>Made to be experienced.</h1><p>From festival campaigns to university classrooms, we bring creative work to new audiences and help others build their own.</p></section>
  <section class="container story-section" aria-labelledby="esya-title">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="section-label">Media and promotion</span><h2 id="esya-title">ESYA</h2></div>
    <div class="story-body"><p>We created promotional media for ESYA, IIIT Delhi's premier tech fest, bringing the festival to life through animation and visual storytelling.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="film-gallery">
      <figure class="story-media"><video src={esyaFilm} controls preload="metadata" playsinline aria-label="ESYA Horizon promotional film"></video><figcaption>ESYA Horizon / Festival promotional film.</figcaption></figure>
      <figure class="story-media"><video src={esyaFirst} controls preload="metadata" playsinline aria-label="ESYA promotional film"></video><figcaption>ESYA / Promotional film.</figcaption></figure>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="container story-section" aria-labelledby="teaching-title">
    <div class="story-heading"><span class="section-label">Sharing what we know</span><h2 id="teaching-title">Teaching</h2></div>
    <div class="story-body"><p>Our founders dedicate significant time to teaching university courses and creating new self-growth courses in Unreal Engine. Through hands-on learning, we help students turn their ideas into interactive experiences.</p><a class="button secondary" href="/community">Explore our learning community</a></div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>

<style>
  .film-gallery { grid-column: 1 / -1; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 28px; }
  .film-gallery video { width: 100%; height: 480px; object-fit: contain; background: #595a4b; }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .film-gallery { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .film-gallery video { height: auto; max-height: 540px; } }
</style>
